    <Description>Hello Keyran users, this combo is perfect for people who want to play legitimately. It's a rather simple combo but very useful at the same time, and like all the combos I've created, it's an instakill."

Instructions:
"To use this combo, follow these steps carefully:

Download the macro and preferably assign it to the control key.
The best way to execute this combo is by using rapids, so throw them first along with the grand slam.
Use contra and high speed while deploying rapids, and when you activate high speed, press the control key!</Description>
